  "en": {
    "id": 5012041,
    "name": "Assistant Graffiti: Slacker",
    "desc": "Without external pressure, many talented creators would go their whole lives without churning out a single word. The Assistant Graffiti is an imagenae born to solve this social issue.\\nHowever, they sometimes resort to overly drastic measures, forcing creators to fight back, which has spiraled into a brand-new social issue entirely.\\nThis particular Assistant Graffiti specializes in dealing with missed deadlines. Oh, you're a last-minute writer, huh? Well, now you don't have to write anything at all!",
